      "description": "This layer's pinned-upstream registry, `upstream-pins.json` (`\"$schema\": \"folio-upstream-pins/v1\"`): one row for each upstream dependency whose pin literal is in a file this layer holds (today only the pdf.js viewer, pinned in `scripts/pdf-viewer.ts`). Each row names the file the pin is READ from (`pinnedIn`, resolved against this instance's root), the pattern that reads it, and what of ours binds to the dependency; it holds no version. `bun run cat check:upstream-pins` reads it together with cat-harness's `upstream/` registry (`cat-harness-upstream`), which keeps the rows whose files are in the harness, since a harness row naming a file in this layer would be a wrong-direction reference. `code`: the checker's input table, not content any reader renders.",
